# Title: Potentially Suspicious GoogleUpdate Child Process
# ID: 84b1ecf9-6eff-4004-bafb-bae5c0e251b2
# Status: test
# Level: high
# Author: Nasreddine Bencherchali (Nextron Systems)
# Date: 2023-05-15
# Tags: attack.stealth
# Description: Detects potentially suspicious child processes of "GoogleUpdate.exe"
# Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

((parent_name:*\\GoogleUpdate.exe) AND -(((-process_name:*) OR ((process_name:*\\Google*) OR ((process_name:*\\setup.exe OR process_name:*chrome_updater.exe OR process_name:*chrome_installer.exe))))))
